      $('#l12Lev', root).innerHTML = `<div class="xscroll"><table class="prose"><thead><tr><th class="l">Lever</th><th class="l">ZIPs</th><th class="l">What it changes</th></tr></thead><tbody>${SLM.LEVER_DEFS.map(([k, name, def]) => `<tr><td><span class="sev" style="background:${LEVC()[k]}"></span>${name}</td><td>${N(cnt(k))}</td><td>${esc(def)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="mini" style="margin-top:8px">Also flagged per ZIP: apartment heavy (units in buildings of two or more at 45% or above: property manager buying), heat vulnerable (owners 65 and over at 25% with pre 1980 stock at 40%: heat safety creative and maintenance plans) and permit gap (observed permits under 15% of modeled replacements in the three permit cities: "permitted and inspected" is a differentiator there). Map layer: Dominant audience lever.</p>`;
